/* PORT: angband-picocalc stage 070 item 3. Overrides pico-sdk 2.3.0's one-line
   pico_standard_link/script_include/default_rodata_excludes.incl. CMake substitutes the
   object patterns from ANGBAND_SRAM_OBJECTS in CMakeLists.txt. NEVER NAME THE SUBSTITUTION
   INSIDE THIS COMMENT: every pattern starts with a star and a slash, which ends it.

   The hot core objects' read-only data (cave.c's ddgrid/ddx/ddy tables, which the noise
   flood reads eight times a grid) must leave flash with their code, or the loop is still
   alternating chip selects -- only now between SRAM code, flash tables and the PSRAM heap.
   Excluded .rodata lands in SRAM by section_default_data.incl's `*(.rodata*)` catch-all. */

*(EXCLUDE_FILE(*libgcc.a: *libc.a: *lib*_a-mem*.o *libm.a:@ANGBAND_SRAM_PATTERNS@) .rodata*)
